<title>USA: Winsloew sees Q3 net shr $0.24-$0.25.</title>
<headline>Winsloew sees Q3 net shr $0.24-$0.25.</headline>
<dateline>PELHAM, Ala. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>WinsLoew Furniture Inc said Wednesday earnings for its third quarter ended September 30 are expected to be about $0.24 to $0.25 per share, which would be higher than analysts estimates.</p>
<p>First Call projected earnings of $0.14 for the quarter.</p>
<p>The company expects to report its 1996 third quarter results October 21.</p>
</text>
